        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LOT 1 — Entire Holding: Cottage on 0.66 Acre + c.9 Acres of Agricultural Land** \r\n\r\nGuide Price: €295,000 \r\n\r\nKW Properties | Keller Williams \r\n\r\nA rare chance to secure a complete residential and agricultural holding in one of East Galway’s most peaceful rural settings. Lot 1 combines the traditional cottage on 0.66 acre with c.9 acres of quality farmland, offering a versatile package that appeals to homeowners, farmers, investors and anyone seeking space, privacy and longterm value. Opportunities like this — a home with land, clean boundaries, strong accessibility and genuine potential — simply do not come to market often. This is a holding that rewards vision, whether you want to live on site, farm the land, expand your acreage, or secure a futureproof investment. \r\n\r\nWhat This Holding Offers - A traditional threebedroom cottage with character and renovation potential - A defined 0.66acre residential site with outbuildings - c.9 acres of agricultural land positioned to the front and rear - A peaceful rural setting just minutes from Woodford village - Strong road access and a practical land layout - A rare opportunity to purchase a homeandland package in one transaction This is a compact yet powerful holding — manageable, flexible and full of opportunity. \r\n\r\nWhy Buyers Will Be Drawn to This Property This full package suits a wide range of buyers: - Those seeking a countryside home with land - Farmers expanding their acreage - Hobby farmers or equestrian users - Buyers wanting a renovation project with room to grow - Investors securing longterm, lowrisk land assets - Anyone wanting privacy, space and potential in a strong rural location The combination of a standalone cottage and usable farmland makes this a standout offering in the East Galway market. \r\n\r\nA Holding With Clear Future Value Whether you choose to modernise the cottage, farm the land, or simply secure a versatile rural asset, this property offers longterm security and flexibility. Land and residential holdings of this scale remain consistently soughtafter — and once they’re gone, they’re gone. If you’re considering a home with land, this is the moment to act. \r\n\r\nProperties like this — with character, acreage and potential — attract strong interest. Walking the site makes the value immediately clear. \r\n\r\nViewing \r\nKW Properties | Keller Williams Kathleen Walet — 085 786 0953"
